---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn what pfseeker is, what .pfseeker® represents, and how the curated profile-media platform is being built."
>
  <section class="page-shell prose-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 id="about-title">
        pfseeker is a curated profile-media discovery platform.
      </h1>
      <p>
        The expressive mark `.pfseeker®` frames the product as a precise profile
        seeker: a place for finding profile pictures, banners, icons, and
        aesthetic collections.
      </p>
    </div>
    <section aria-labelledby="about-content-title">
      <h2 id="about-content-title">What is being built</h2>
      <p>
        pfseeker is under active development. The current site provides the
        product shell, design system, and honest route structure before
        publishing real media libraries.
      </p>
      <p>
        The curation goal is to make profile media easier to browse, compare,
        save, and download without noisy templates or fabricated content.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
